{"duration_api_ms":892065,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"d736310d-54a8-46ee-b12f-52c6134d40c7","total_cost_usd":5.918757999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":306,"cache_creation_input_tokens":179888,"cache_read_input_tokens":22313675,"output_tokens":72108,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":35024},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":179888,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3298,"cache_read_input_tokens":196441,"cache_creation_input_tokens":471,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":471},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":14684,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.014778999999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":306,"outputTokens":72108,"cacheReadInputTokens":22313675,"cacheCreationInputTokens":179888,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":5.903978999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":35024,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":186,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"Published node4's lan-b HTTP service (port 8080) on TCP port 80 of node2's (OPNsense) transit address 10.10.10.2 via a destination-NAT port-forward, and gave node1 (VyOS) a route to that transit address by assigning its transit interface (eth1=10.10.10.1/30) and lan-a interface (eth2=10.10.20.254/24). node3 on lan-a now reaches the service by curling node2's transit address only, with no direct route/reachability to node4. Discovered and fixed two non-obvious issues: (1) OPNsense pf evaluates filter 'pass' rules against the POST-NAT destination, so the pass rule had to target 10.10.30.10:8080 (not the original 10.10.10.2:80); (2) node2 needed an explicit static route back to lan-a (10.10.20.0/24 via 10.10.10.1) since it is two hops away, not directly connected. All four nodes were then restarted one at a time (node4, node2, node1, node3), with boot-identity change proven via boot_id/kern.boottime and uptime, and full recovery of addressing, NAT/firewall rules, static routes, the http-lanb systemd service, and end-to-end curl reachability confirmed after each restart.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Mapped physical topology via arping probes: node1 eth1<->node2 vtnet1 (transit), node1 eth2<->node3 enp8s0 (lan-a), node2 vtnet2<->node4 enp8s0 (lan-b)\",\"Configured node1 (VyOS): eth1=10.10.10.1/30, eth2=10.10.20.254/24, forward-filter default-drop + established/related + lan-a->transit tcp/80 accept; committed and saved\",\"Configured node2 (OPNsense) via config.xml surgery: assigned opt1(vtnet1)=10.10.10.2/30 and opt2(vtnet2)=10.10.30.254/24; added filter pass rule and NAT port-forward rdr opt1:80->10.10.30.10:8080; fixed pass rule to match post-NAT destination; added persistent static route 10.10.20.0/24 via 10.10.10.1 (gateway TRANSIT_GW) in config.xml\",\"Configured node3 (RHEL) via nmcli: enp8s0=10.10.20.10/24 plus static route 10.10.10.0/30 via 10.10.20.254\",\"Configured node4 (RHEL) via nmcli: enp8s0=10.10.30.10/24 plus static route 10.10.20.0/24 via 10.10.30.254; created and enabled systemd service http-lanb.service (python3 http.server on 0.0.0.0:8080) since no service was pre-existing; opened firewalld port 8080/tcp\",\"Verified end-to-end: node3 curl http://10.10.10.2:80/ returns node4's content (200) repeatedly; node3 has no route to node4 directly (000)\",\"Captured pre-restart baselines (boot_id/kern.boottime, uptime, service/interface/route state) and restarted node4, node2, node1, node3 sequentially via native reboot mechanisms, confirming changed boot identity and full recovery (addressing, NAT/firewall/static routes, http-lanb service, end-to-end curl) after each\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Physical topology discovery (transit/lan-a/lan-b link mapping)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-fa4a6ec4513d4e77\",\"cmd-4dce2fa041fe4731\",\"cmd-ac2d2643e6a64b27\",\"cmd-4a099944b6e84751\",\"cmd-198b20f66e7a43bf\"],\"summary\":\"arping confirmed node1 eth1<->node2 vtnet1, node1 eth2<->node3 enp8s0, node2 vtnet2<->node4 enp8s0\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 (VyOS) transit+lan-a addressing and forward firewall configured/committed\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-e026617ebc9b4dde\",\"cmd-5742f42ba96941dc\",\"cmd-78eb78224fba4b59\",\"cmd-0aa7034bd1694bc2\"],\"summary\":\"eth1=10.10.10.1/30, eth2=10.10.20.254/24 set; forward-filter default-drop + established/related + lan-a->transit:80 accept; committed+saved; connected routes present\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 (OPNsense) publishes node4:8080 on its transit address:80 via NAT+firewall\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-eaed6a492e3e4df3\",\"cmd-c028f57437f34b2a\",\"cmd-e540d6ccbf044937\",\"cmd-06bc949c12c64d1b\"],\"summary\":\"opt1=10.10.10.2/30 (transit), opt2=10.10.30.254/24 (lan-b); rdr opt1:80->10.10.30.10:8080; pass rule fixed to match post-NAT destination 10.10.30.10:8080\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 given a route to node2's transit address (task's explicit ask)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-0aa7034bd1694bc2\"],\"summary\":\"node1's connected route to 10.10.10.0/30 via eth1 (created by assigning the transit interface address) gives node1 the path to node2's transit address 10.10.10.2\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 route back to lan-a (needed two-hop return path, non-obvious fix)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-87ea45c770a94b73\",\"cmd-c5cbe0f0c567459f\",\"cmd-68eb505f9430487f\"],\"summary\":\"Added and persisted static route 10.10.20.0/24 via 10.10.10.1 on node2 (config.xml gateway_item + staticroutes), confirmed present after filter reload\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3/node4 lan interface addressing and node4 HTTP service provisioning\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-048016926e6a4903\",\"cmd-18274e12491c466b\",\"cmd-c14079f66fcc4995\",\"cmd-c63728d2aeb74eb9\"],\"summary\":\"node3 enp8s0=10.10.20.10/24 + route to transit; node4 enp8s0=10.10.30.10/24 + route to lan-a; http-lanb.service created/enabled, firewalld 8080/tcp opened\"},{\"requirement\":\"End-to-end acceptance: node3 reaches service via node2's transit address only, not via node4 directly\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6c88ab3ec8cf4c3c\",\"cmd-b4efaa42101f460a\"],\"summary\":\"node3 curl to 10.10.10.2:80 returns node4's content (200) consistently across 4 attempts; node3 has no route/reachability directly to 10.10.30.10 (000)\"},{\"requirement\":\"node4 restart: baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-72cccefd393c4cf3\",\"cmd-f70474545c45479f\",\"cmd-a23c3c96d03d4dee\",\"cmd-06f3387b432843a7\",\"cmd-9709bb4cfb794d5c\",\"cmd-a86b81c565d34f05\"],\"summary\":\"boot_id 6ab6a71b->6a4ee94c; http-lanb.service, IP, route, and end-to-end curl (200) all recovered post-reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-07beeac050da4e45\",\"cmd-0340c69670794508\",\"cmd-4a1d7f0f5455422c\",\"cmd-8819801701a34ee5\",\"cmd-383b6e4be3e6423f\",\"cmd-b5af6f50aac548bf\"],\"summary\":\"kern.boottime 1788672034->1788673348; interfaces, NAT rdr, filter pass rule, and static route all recovered from config.xml; end-to-end curl (200) confirmed\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: